      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While the station is large, it's not necessarily a chaotic mess, but it can certainly feel overwhelming if you're unfamiliar with the layout. It's a big, busy hub, and finding your specific platform can take a few minutes, especially if you're carrying bags. I recommend checking the departure boards well in advance, or even using the station's digital maps, so you can navigate with the confidence of a seasoned traveler. It's better to have that extra time than to rush around frantically when the train is about to leave!",
